# ThreadSanitizer suppressions, passed via TSAN_OPTIONS by CI and tests/soak_all.sh.
#
# Intentionally empty.  A new entry needs a comment proving the race benign; a
# seqlock-style overlap does not qualify -- move those bytes as relaxed atomics
# instead with store_words / load_words (kickmsg/types.h), as the Blackboard does
# for value payloads and key text and the registry does for participant names.
